&lt;li&gt;Based in Washington D.C., Illinois, Maryland, Massachusetts or California (outside of the San Francisco Bay Area): $XXX,XXX (Developing Minimum for Tier 2) - $XXX,XXX ( Mid for Tier 2).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in New York, New Jersey, Washington State, or the San Francisco Bay area, California: $XXX,XXX (Developing Minimum for Tier 1) - $XXX,XXX ( Mid for Tier 1).&lt;/li&gt;
